{"version":1,"pages":[{"id":"p3","title":"3. How it works (/how-it-works) · cycle 2","shapes":[{"id":"doc-title-p3","type":"text","boundingBox":{"x":0,"y":-860,"w":4400,"h":200},"text":"<p style='font-size:40pt;text-align:left'><b>Harvest concept site · Cycle 2 review (PR #1)</b><br><span style='font-size:20pt'>How it works page (viewport screens) · Desktop 1440×1024 · commit 7a89b64 · https://deploy-preview-1--harvest-for-lucid.netlify.app</span></p>"},{"id":"legend-box-p3","type":"text","boundingBox":{"x":0,"y":-560,"w":2600,"h":360},"text":"<p style='font-size:22pt;text-align:left'><b>How to review</b><br>Leave feedback as sticky notes INSIDE the screen's frame. Start a note with <b>Do:</b>, <b>Must do</b>, <b>Try:</b> or <b>Consider:</b> to set its priority (the words win over the colour); otherwise the colour counts: <span style='color:#C62828'><b>Red = Do / Must do</b></span>, <span style='color:#9A7B00'><b>Yellow = Try</b></span>, <span style='color:#1565C0'><b>Blue = Consider</b></span>. <span style='color:#BA23F6'><b>Purple = Board format</b></span> (notes about this board's layout). Comments are read as general feedback.</p>"},{"id":"legend-must-p3","type":"rectangle","boundingBox":{"x":2700,"y":-530,"w":260,"h":300},"style":{"fill":{"type":"color","color":"#FF8A80"},"stroke":{"color":"#C62828","width":2,"style":"solid"}},"text":"<p style='font-size:24pt;text-align:center'><b>Red</b><br>Do / Must do</p>"},{"id":"legend-try-p3","type":"rectangle","boundingBox":{"x":3020,"y":-530,"w":260,"h":300},"style":{"fill":{"type":"color","color":"#FFE066"},"stroke":{"color":"#9A7B00","width":2,"style":"solid"}},"text":"<p style='font-size:24pt;text-align:center'><b>Yellow</b><br>Try</p>"},{"id":"legend-maybe-p3","type":"rectangle","boundingBox":{"x":3340,"y":-530,"w":260,"h":300},"style":{"fill":{"type":"color","color":"#A3E4FF"},"stroke":{"color":"#1565C0","width":2,"style":"solid"}},"text":"<p style='font-size:24pt;text-align:center'><b>Blue</b><br>Consider</p>"},{"id":"legend-board-p3","type":"rectangle","boundingBox":{"x":3660,"y":-530,"w":260,"h":300},"style":{"fill":{"type":"color","color":"#BA23F6"},"stroke":{"color":"#7B1FA2","width":2,"style":"solid"},"textColor":"#FFFFFF"},"text":"<p style='font-size:24pt;text-align:center'><b>Purple</b><br>Board format</p>"},{"id":"frame-how-01-top","type":"sparkFrame","boundingBox":{"x":0,"y":0,"w":2240,"h":3630},"style":{"fill":{"type":"color","color":"#F2F3F5"},"stroke":{"color":"#F2F3F5","width":0,"style":"solid"}},"customData":[{"key":"stepKey","value":"how-01-top"},{"key":"route","value":"/how-it-works"},{"key":"cycle","value":"2"},{"key":"flow","value":"how-it-works"}],"title":"how-01-top · /how-it-works · How Harvest works | Lucid"},{"id":"img-how-01-top","type":"image","boundingBox":{"x":400,"y":400,"w":1440,"h":1024},"image":{"type":"image","url":"https://journey-assets-ai-xform.netlify.app/harvest-site-c2-how-it-works/01-how-01-top.png"},"stroke":{"color":"#C9CED8","width":2,"style":"solid"}},{"id":"hdr-how-01-top","type":"text","boundingBox":{"x":400,"y":1784,"w":1440,"h":200},"text":"<p style='font-size:22pt;text-align:left'><b>1. how-01-top</b>  ·  /how-it-works<br><span style='font-size:16pt'>How Harvest works | Lucid  —  h1: “From prototype to pull request, one review cycle at a time”  —  no click</span></p>"},{"id":"changes-how-it-works-1","type":"text","boundingBox":{"x":400,"y":2044,"w":1280,"h":464},"text":"<p style='font-size:20pt;text-align:left'><b>Changes in this cycle</b> (vs cycle 1)<br><br>• [must] “Get on the list” announcement banner removed (#1)<br>• [try] Eyebrow “How it works” removed (#5)<br>• [try] Single header: Lucid menu bar removed, sticky Harvest nav with “Join the beta”; product renamed “Harvest” (#3)</p>"},{"id":"before-lbl-how-it-works-1","type":"text","boundingBox":{"x":400,"y":2568,"w":840,"h":90},"text":"<p style='font-size:20pt;text-align:left'><b>Cycle 1 (before) · reference only</b></p>"},{"id":"before-img-how-it-works-1","type":"image",